Key&nbsp;Responsibilities &nbsp;

• Retouch live action and stock images, executing creative direction on colour correction or compositing for still images. &nbsp;

• Adapt&nbsp;photorealistic, high-quality&nbsp;renders&nbsp;of 3D models for various projects, with a focus on packaging and advertising visuals. This includes product shots, lifestyle imagery&nbsp;for use in marketing materials, e-commerce, and other platforms. &nbsp;

• Collaborate with 3D modelers, designers, and other artists to ensure visual consistency and project quality, paying close attention to brand guidelines and client expectations. &nbsp;

• Help on new business pitches and creative briefs for brand teams, swapping logos and compositing brand assets into different settings &nbsp;

• Must be able to&nbsp;use photoshop to create&nbsp;high quality&nbsp;packaging&nbsp;renders&nbsp;immigrating premium finishes like emboss, debias spot gloss, metallics etc… &nbsp;

• Set up lighting, materials, textures to achieve the desired look and feel, considering the specific requirements of packaging materials and printing processes. &nbsp;

• Stay up to date with the latest trends and techniques in rendering and software relevant to packaging visualization and advertising. &nbsp;

• Troubleshoot technical issues and find creative solutions to&nbsp;retouching and compositing&nbsp;challenges, proactively addressing potential problems. &nbsp;

• Manage multiple projects simultaneously and meet deadlines effectively, prioritizing tasks and managing time efficiently. &nbsp;

